OL,3,GNEWSA'Talking about losing a parent by
OL,4,Asuicide is taboo'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man whose father died by suicide when
OL,7,Fhe was a teenager has swum the English
OL,8,FChannel twice this year to fundraise
OL,9,Ffor a space where people can open up
OL,10,Fand talk.
OL,12,FMax Ashken, from Harleston, Norfolk,
OL,13,Fsaid his dad Peter had struggled with
OL,14,Fprolonged mental health issues before
OL,15,Fhis death in 2022.
OL,17,F"It is hard to talk about - it's
OL,18,Funcomfortable, it's taboo; a lot of
OL,19,Fpeople who go through it, and kids that
OL,20,Fhave lost a parent, sometimes don't
OL,21,Ftell anyone," he said.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
