OL,3,GNEWSA'Talking about losing a parent by
OL,4,Asuicide is taboo'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe 22-year-old, who went to school in
OL,7,FWoodbridge in Suffolk, has been raising
OL,8,Fmoney for the charity Mind and said
OL,9,Ffocusing on his training and taking
OL,10,Fpart in the extreme challenges helped
OL,11,Fhim "grow as a person".
